# VoiceVision Feature: Mute TTS (T029)
# Source: src/voicevision/pipeline.py, src/voicevision/listen.py

## PipelineConfig.mute_tts
- Default: False
- When True: skips TTS synthesis in all pipeline paths

## Pipeline.process()
- Checks config.mute_tts before calling tts.synthesize()
- Still runs VAD→STT→LLM→filter
- Returns empty bytes instead of synthesized speech

## Pipeline.process_stream() / _stream_transcript() / _process_transcript_sync()
- All respect mute_tts flag
- When muted: yields nothing instead of TTS chunks

## Pipeline.describe_and_answer()
- Returns empty bytes when muted

## ListenConfig.mute_tts
- CLI: --mute flag
- Env: VOICEVISION_MUTE_TTS=1
- Useful for: testing, logging LLM responses, chaining with another TTS